```

The actual implementation may improve this model.

Keep musical moments separate from their supporting evidence.

Create a MomentEvidence entity containing:

- Evidence ID.
- Moment ID.
- Observation ID.
- Evidence type.
- Observed playback position.
- Timestamp.
- Confidence.
- Evidence origin.

Support these discovery methods:

- USER_MARKED.
- REPLAY_PATTERN.
- SEEK_BACK_PATTERN.
- INFERRED_PATTERN.

Only user-confirmed moments should be presented as explicitly chosen favourites.

## 5.4 My Musical Moments

Create a dedicated frontend section named:

MY MUSICAL MOMENTS

It should display:

- Saved moments.
